{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hydroplant Tycoon</i> follows the journey of an ordinary white-collar worker who, upon receiving an unexpected offer from his uncle, embarks on building a sustainable hydroponic farming empire in the city center. With your uncle's investment support, construct a high-tech farm from scratch and discover the perfect harmony between nature and technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 From Seedling to Harvest: The Farming Process</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey by purchasing various seeds from the market.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully germinate your seeds using appropriate equipment to grow healthy seedlings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transfer your seedlings to hydroponic systems that rely on nutrient-rich water instead of soil.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage water flow, nutrient balance, and environmental conditions to maximize efficiency.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different plant species, each with unique growth rates and market values, to diversify your crops.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your uncle's allocated land becomes a space visited by city dwellers. Among these visitors, there may be thieves; stay vigilant and protect your farm when necessary. Causing harm to non-thief visitors results in monetary penalties imposed by your uncle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your land by acquiring new greenhouses and cultivate plants wherever you desire. Items placed neatly inside greenhouses are more challenging for thieves to steal.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621000?t=1748286153","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621000/c368a813d359a3141a12b840c9b7820d435133b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748286153","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i